  "question": "Where\u2019s the closest gallery as you move from the Dinosaur Place at Nature's Art Village, Montville, CT in the direction of Casey Farm, Saunderstown, RI?",
  "sql": "WITH\n    angle AS (SELECT degrees(ST_Azimuth(ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-72.222926 41.432518)',4326)::geography, ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-71.423542 41.512145)',4326)::geography)) AS value)\nSELECT * FROM pois,angle\nWHERE tourism = 'gallery'\nAND (degrees(ST_Azimuth(ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-72.222926 41.432518)',4326)::geography, pois.geometry)) BETWEEN angle.value - 22.5 AND angle.value + 22.5)\nORDER BY pois.geometry <-> ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-72.222926 41.432518)',4326)::geography ASC\nLIMIT 1;\n",
